LOCATION:Co-working La Bergerie\, Place du Midi 50\, Sion
DESCRIPTION:Valais SMEs see how AI agents can take over routine admin — c
 lient requests\, bookings\, contracts and follow-up — with a live tool d
 emo and a local case study from the Sion coworking space.\n\nOrganiser: Sw
 iss Digital Center / Fondation The Ark (with CCI Valais)\n\nDetails and re
 gistration: https://swissdataevents.ch/events/digital-series-13-automatisa
 tion-ia-sion-2026/
